---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Book a Free Call
permalink: /book/
description: "Book a free 30-minute call about your farm's website, online store, or marketing. Tuesday–Friday, 3–7pm Eastern."
hideCta: true
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Let's talk about your farm.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A free 30-minute call, {{ site.hours }}. Pick a time below.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap book-grid">
    <div>
      {% if site.bookingUrl %}
        <iframe class="booking-frame" src="{{ site.bookingUrl }}{% if '?' in site.bookingUrl %}&{% else %}?{% endif %}gv=true" title="Pick a time for a free call" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        <p class="small muted">Calendar not loading? <a href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the booking page</a>.</p>
      {% else %}
        <div class="booking-fallback">
          <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem">Online booking is almost ready</h2>
          <p>Until it is, call or text <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> with a couple of times that work, and I'll send an invite.</p>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem;font-size:1.5rem">What we'll cover</h2>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>What you sell, how you sell it now, and what's not working</li>
        <li>Whether I can help, and which package fits, if any</li>
        <li>What it would cost and how long it would take</li>
      </ul>
      <p>No sales pitch. If I'm not the right fit, I'll tell you.</p>

      <h2 id="write" style="margin-top:2.5rem">Rather write than talk?</h2>
      {% set tallyId = site.tally.intake %}{% set tallyTitle = "Tell me about your farm" %}{% set tallyThanks = "" %}
      {% include "partials/tally.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2>Or reach me directly</h2>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin-bottom:.25rem">Call or text</p>
        <p class="contact-big"><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin:1rem 0 .25rem">Email</p>
        <p class="contact-big" style="font-size:1.125rem;word-break:break-word"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:1rem">{{ site.hoursShort }}. Based in Indianapolis, working with farms anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="pdf-card" href="/assets/pdf/working-with-cultivate.pdf">
        <span class="pdf-icon" aria-hidden="true">PDF</span>
        <span><strong>Working With Cultivate</strong><span class="small muted">The four packages, prices, and how it works, on one page.</span></span>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="https://tally.so/widgets/embed.js" async onload="Tally.loadEmbeds()"></script>
